cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NewtonianPropagator in your research or mission design workflows, please cite it as below."
title: "NewtonianPropagator: A Modular Multi-Body Astrodynamics and Trajectory Optimization Engine"
abstract: >-
  NewtonianPropagator is a high-fidelity astrodynamics simulation engine written in Python.
  It provides multi-body gravitational propagation, Circular Restricted Three-Body Problem (CR3BP)
  dynamics, perturbed orbital mechanics (J2–J4, SRP, atmospheric drag), Lambert boundary-value
  targeting, low-thrust propulsion modeling, and launch vehicle C3 capacity analysis.
type: software
